    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ability to use a Holy Symbol or Druidic Focus as a Spellcasting Focus<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Craft</p><p>Icons of your religion are displayed here, with a quiet place for worship.</p><p><strong>Sanctuary Charm.</strong> After you spend a Long Rest in your Bastion, you gain a magical Charm that lasts for 7 days or until you use it, letting you cast Healing Word once without expending a spell slot. You can't gain this Charm again while you still have it.</p><p><strong>Craft: Sacred Focus.</strong> The hireling crafts a Druidic Focus (wooden staff) or a Holy Symbol in 7 days, at no cost. It stays in your Bastion until you claim it.</p>",
